start: mr
R1: C1@{3ch=dc {2dc 2ch [3dc 2ch]x3}@ring ss@top} # text says rep 13 times
R2: C2@{3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch]x3 ss@top}
R3: C3@{3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch 3dc@sp ch [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch 3dc@sp ch]x3 ss@top}
R4: C4@{3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x2 [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x2]x3 ss@top}
R5: C5@{3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch 3dc@sp ch dc@sp fpdtr fpdtr ch 3dc@sp ch [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch 3dc@sp ch dc@sp fpdtr fpdtr ch 3dc@sp ch]x3 ss@top} # fpdtr into R2; first side follows the repeat, not "ch1, ch1"
